From 6701952c3c2d9820b71e63d2a5eb0688b4baa4b9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Zxilly <zhouxinyu1001@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 20:00:34 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 08/22] all: share WebAssembly library implementations with
 wasm32

Use the existing WebAssembly library implementations on wasm32. Share
the memchr helper and math assembly between wasm and wasm32, and apply
the same recursion limits and platform-specific test exclusions.

Updates #63131

Change-Id: I560d380db5d62f91d5d0844d84c6e4f174474c22

